  "description": "LIGHTNESS ABOVE ALL\n\nBuilt like all BH high-end frames using HCIM (Hollow Core Internal Moulding) carbon moulding technology that allows the weight of the frame and tie rod to be reduced to a minimum. With the highest quantity of high modulus fibres to achieve a weight of 2.065 grams, including its shock absorber.\n\nBHZ BY SEG MOTOR\n\nExperience the power of the BHZ motor by SEG, which at only 2.1 kg transforms your pedaling into speed and energy. With a maximum torque of 65 Nm and a nominal power of 250 W, reaching up to 500 W, this motor is designed to deliver exceptional performance.\n\n+ MILES\n\nAll models come equipped with a 630Wh battery located in the down tube, weighing 2.6 kg. This battery, composed of 21700 cells with 5.8Ah, offers maximum energy density and allows more energy to be stored in a compact space, resulting in a low center of gravity for natural handling. Additionally, the external XPro battery provides an extra 180Wh, increasing the range to 4600m of elevation gain.\n\nGEOMETRY 100 or 120 mm\n\nAchieve the best balance between aggressiveness and stability. To do so, we have extended the reach to between 10 and 20 mm, the steering angle is between 68º and 67º, with short chainstays that maintain agility on ascents and descents. Because we use the “Metric” standard, the Lynx Race offers 100 mm or 120 mm of travel, maintaining the same level of anti-squat - ensuring pedalling efficiency - and brake squat - ensuring an outstanding braking performance.\n\n+ STIFFNESS\n\nA new main suspension axle, which is oversized and has self-aligning bearings, increasing torsional stiffness by 30%.\n\nFIT\n\nOur FIT system includes all of the necessary tools to allow you to get back home if there is a fault. The H2.5/3/4/5/6, T25, chain tool, CO2 adaptor and quick-release chain are all included. Upgrade Kit.",
